iation (2026-10-17, same owner approval): financial.mjs (S11 remaining-balance partial disbursement from #473, on top of the release's users-only membership rules), identity.mjs (live mortgageAgentStatus) and tenant-admin.mjs (live production Cognito lock bind on invite, mortgage_agent_accounts on hire) were re-pinned to the reconciled branch bytes; expected live values are unchanged.",
